{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","暗影打击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","그림자 타격"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","闪现到敌方身边进行多段攻击。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","적 곁으로 순간이동하여 수차례 공격을 진행한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","闪现到一名敌军身边，先对目标造成3次100% ATK伤害，之后短暂冻结目标并跳起再对目标造成150% + 20% ATK伤害，在此期间自身处于无敌状态，随后额外回复终极技能期间造成总伤害25%的生命值。优先选择最虚弱的敌军为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","적군 1명의 옆으로 순간이동하여 목표에게100% ATK의 대미지를 3회 입힌 다음, 목표를 잠시 빙결시킨 후 점프하여 150% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 이때 자신은 무적 상태가 되며, 궁극기 시전 기간에 입힌 총 대미지의 25% 만큼 HP를 추가 회복한다. HP가 가장 낮은 적군을 우선으로 공격한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":70,"end":76,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":105,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":22,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":66,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":99,"end":101,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":151,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","점프 시 목표에게 입히는 대미지가 160% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层“嗜血”使额外回复的生命值提升至总伤害的15%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","학살 중첩마다 추가로 회복하는 HP가 총 대미지의 15%로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","점프 시 목표에게 입히는 대미지가 170% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","점프 시 목표에게 입히는 대미지가 180% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","弱肉强食"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","약육강식"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","飞扑到附近最虚弱的敌人身边造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","주변 HP가 가장 낮은 적 곁으로 뛰어들어 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","飞扑至范围内最虚弱的敌军身边，对其造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，并附带目标已损失生命值25%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过赛特斯400%的攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","범위 내 HP가 가장 낮은 적군의 곁으로 덮쳐들어 150% + 15% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 목표가 잃은 HP의 25%만큼 추가 대미지를 입힌다. 추가 대미지의 최대치는 세스 공격력의 400%를 초과하지 않는다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 160% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 170% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 180% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","猎手本能"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","헌터의 본능"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌人生命值过低时自身获得属性加成。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","적의 HP가 매우 낮을 때 자신은 속성 보너스를 획득한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当场上召唤物以外的敌军生命值百分比首次低于33%时，赛特斯获得一层“嗜血”，永久提升10 + 1.5点急速与7 + 1点生命汲取，最多叠加3层。首次获得“嗜血”时赛特斯还会额外提高自身25%的护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전장에 소환물이 아닌 적의 HP 비율이 처음으로 33%보다 낮아지면 세스는 학살을 1스택 획득하여, 급속이 10 + 1.5, 생명 흡수가 7 + 1 영구 증가한다(최대 3스택 중첩 가능). 학살 첫 획득 시 추가로 25%의 물리 방어력과 마법 방어력이 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":55,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":62,"end":68,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":78,"end":82,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","场上召唤物以外的敌军血量百分比首次低于50%时便可获得一层“嗜血”。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전장에 소환물이 아닌 적의 HP 비율이 처음으로 50%보다 낮아지면 학살을 1스택 획득할 수 있다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层“嗜血”永久提升12 + 1.5点急速与10 + 1点生命汲取。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","학살 중첩당 급속이 12 + 1.5, 생명 흡수가 10 + 1 영구 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":24,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","首次获得“嗜血”时还会额外获得25点暴击。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","학살 첫 획득 시 추가로 치명타가 25 중가한다."],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 공격력이 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격력이 12% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격력이 16% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격력이 20% 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","追猎狂欢"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","광란의 사냥"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","有敌人被击败时，“弱肉强食”立即冷却完毕，且回复一定能量。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","적이 처치당할 시 약육강식이 즉시 쿨타임을 완료하며 일정량의 에너지를 회복한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当一名召唤物以外的敌军被击败时，“弱肉强食”立即冷却完毕，并为自身恢复200点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","소환물을 제외한 적군 1명이 처치당할 때마다 약육강식이 즉시 쿨타임을 완료하며 에너지를 200 회복한다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次释放“弱肉强食”后，本场战斗内该技能造成的伤害额外提高15%，最多叠加5次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","약육강식을 시전할 때마다 이번 전투에서 해당 스킬로 입히는 대미지가 15% 추가 증가한다(최대 5스택 중첩 가능)."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至240点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","에너지 회복이 240까지 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","恢复能量提升至260点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","에너지 회복이 260까지 증가한다."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放技能“弱肉强食”时若自身拥有“嗜血”效果，则会额外降低目标护甲。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","약육강식 시전 시 학살 효과를 보유하고 있을 경우 목표의 물리 방어력이 추가로 감소한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放技能“弱肉强食”时若自身拥有“嗜血”效果，则每有1层“嗜血”会额外降低目标15%的护甲，持续6秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","약육강식 시전 시에 자신이 학살 효과를 보유하고 있으면 학살 1스택당 목표의 물리 방어력이 15% 추가 감소하며, 6초간 지속된다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","迅牙"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","날쌘 송곳니"]]}